  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to inflict a curse on a target within Far range. The target must make a Knowledge Reaction Roll. On a failure, the target begins coughing up sand and is <em>Sand-Choked</em> until they succeed on a Strength or Presence roll (16). A <em>Sand-Choked</em> target is <em>Vulnerable</em>, can’t speak or cast spells, and must mark a Stress before they make an action roll.</p>",
